OL,3,ARecord 5,200 heat-linked deaths        
OL,4,Aestimated in England this year         
OL,6,FClimate change is expected to increase 
OL,7,Fthe length, frequency and intensity of 
OL,8,Fextreme heat, the UKHSA has warned.    
